---
title: Inverted AeroPress by Blue Bottle
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/blue-bottle-inverted-aeropress/
filter: paper
---

@AeroPress 15g 200g 93°C
grind medium-fine

/invert
0:00 30g ~10s bloom
0:10 /stir ~10s -- 3 or 4 times, until all the coffee is wet
0:20 /wait ~25s
0:45 200g ~10s
0:55 /rinse -- the paper filter in the cap, while it brews
1:45 /flip ~20s -- lock the cap, lift it off the scale, push the air out, then flip onto the cup
2:10 /press ~30s -- gently, with the weight of your arms only

target 2:40
